 399: 			    HRM Table 6-6 lists THIRTEEN (W_MASK<31:20> = 0, 1, 3, 7, ...
 400: 			    0xfff: a contiguous low-ones field), and the old arm STORED
 401: 			    before it checked.  Validate the field, store only when it is
 402: 			    legal, decline once otherwise with the previous value kept.  */
 403: 			{
