 470: 		    list.  Decline the write (no state changes), answer a read with
 471: 		    zero (odata is already 0), announce each direction once.  The
 472: 		    value keeps #506's full width.  NOT all of these offsets are
 473: 		    unimplemented HOLES: STAT0 (+0x040), STAT1 (+0x060), SFT_RST
 474: 		    (+0x0c0) and PAR_DIS (+0x0e0) are DOCUMENTED registers this
